                                                "sense_id": "4ca855be-1eeb-30f7-9d38-d3145f9143b4",
                                                "text": "18 January 1549, Hugh Latimer, Sermon of the Plough\nThey would have us saved by a daily oblation propitiatory; by a sacrifice expiatory, or remissory."
                                            }
